OL,3,AOil hits $100 a barrel for first time
OL,4,Asince July after flare up in US-Iran
OL,5,Aconflict
OL,6,
OL,7,FOil prices rose past $100 a barrel on
OL,8,FWednesday after an overnight escalation
OL,9,Fin the conflict between the US and
OL,10,FIran.
OL,12,FIn back and forth attacks, the US hit
OL,13,Ffive Iranian tankers in reprisal
OL,14,Fstrikes after Tehran targeted one of
OL,15,Fits warships.
OL,17,FBrent crude - which is the global
OL,18,Fbenchmark for prices - has not been as
OL,19,Fexpensive since the end of July, when a
OL,20,Fceasefire between Iran and the US
OL,21,Fcollapsed.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
